    "body": "Good point, we should not run that in this case. Can we add a check for selectedcontent-disabled in the line which returns early when nearestAncestorSelect is null or has the multiple attribute?\n\n> Good point, I think this is lacking test coverage.\n\nI am hoping that this is exhaustive enough: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/7125591",
