    "body": "That said, now that I understand @josepharhar's comment on the rationale here, maybe we do need to break if we hit an ancestor `selectedcontent`, because otherwise the algorithm will go into an infinite loop.  So maybe we want to change this so this particular break is only when the ancestor is a `selectedcontent` element?",
